o 0}\\left(\\frac{{3}^{xyh}-{3}^{xy}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186275865 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-yh}+\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-y}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186275974 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x-h+3y)+\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}\\right)"] [17592186275977 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{h\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-y}-\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-y}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186276146 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{3}^{xy+h}-{3}^{xy}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186276350 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-(y-h)}+\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-y}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186276369 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{2}^{x+h+2y}+{2}^{x+2y}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186276578 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{h\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}\\right)"] [17592186276712 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{(x+h)^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]"] [17592186276738 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]"] [17592186276845 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{3}^{x(y+h)}-{3}^{xy}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277019 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{3}^{x(y-h)}+{3}^{xy}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277058 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277113 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-yh}-\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-y}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277214 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277269 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2h)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]"] [17592186277376 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{(x+h)^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})]"] [17592186277419 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(xh+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277469 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-(y+h)}-\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}-y}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186277646 :answer/value "\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{3}^{xy-h}+{3}^{xy}}{h}\\right)"] [17592186278229 :question/worked-solution "The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x+h,y)-f(x,y)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)={2}^{x+2y},$  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x+h,y)={2}^{x+h+2y}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{2}^{x+h+2y}-{2}^{x+2y}}{h}\\right).\n$$"] [17592186278230 :question/worked-solution "The partial derivative of $f$ with respect to $x$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x+h,y)-f(x,y)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y),$  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x+h,y)=\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+h+3y)-\\operatorname{log}⁡(x+3y)}{h}\\right).\n$$"] [17592186278232 :question/worked-solution "The derivative of $f$ with respect to $y$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x,y+h)-f(x,y)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}},$  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x,y+h)=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}[\\frac{1}{h}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+h+2)^{3}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{(y+2)^{3}})].\n$$"] [17592186278233 :question/worked-solution "The derivative of $f$ with respect to $y$ is given by the limit \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{f(x,y+h)-f(x,y)}{h}\\right).\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)={3}^{xy},$  we have that \n\n$$\nf(x,y+h)={3}^{x(y+h)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\left(\\frac{{3}^{x(y+h)}-{3}^{xy}}{h}\\right).\n$$"] [17592186278234 :question/worked-solution "The derivative of $f$ with respect to $y$ is given by the limit \n\n$